 "remarks": "42 East Avenue, Norwalk, CT  Welcome to this spacious 4-bedroom, 2.5-bath Colonial nestled in a desirable Norwalk location! This inviting home offers a great combination of comfortable living, versatile space, and convenient amenities.  The updated kitchen provides a wonderful space for everyday living and entertaining, complemented by select bathroom updates and fresh paint throughout. Hardwood floors extend throughout the main level, adding warmth and character. Enjoy the added convenience of second-floor laundry.  The finished lower level offers additional flexible living space, featuring two bedrooms and a full bath, making it ideal for guests, extended family, a home office, or recreational use.  Step outside to enjoy the deck overlooking the above-ground pool, perfect for relaxing and entertaining during the warmer months.  Additional features include all-electric utilities and solar panels for added energy efficiency.  Conveniently located in a desirable neighborhood, close to shopping, dining, and everyday amenities, with many conveniences within walking distance.  A wonderful opportunity to enjoy space, flexibility, and convenience in a sought-after Norwalk location!",
